# `rules.create`

Create a new markdown rule (errors if the id is taken).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.rules.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `content` | `string` | yes |
| `scope` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

